        "TileImage": "$($repository 45463b89-0bda-408c-99be-698e1028c24c).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47, Your Targets are the Terrible 5\r\rA failed Muscal band who got canceled for hatespeech\r\rThe Manager- He always boomed up the prices on his tickets.\r\rThe Gutiarists- While one had an electric love for the Manager, the other was a real rockstar wth a gutiar like a battle axe.\r\rThe Singer- He always wanted his voice to be heard by the masses but got cancelled by his controversial words to his songs.\r\rThe Drummer- He always cooked up flavorful beats and kept the group steady.",
